Files redistributed under base/ (for standalone inference)
================================================================================
The following files are copied verbatim from the Laya repository so that this
project can run without downloading the full base model. They remain under the
original Apache License 2.0 and the original copyright:

    base/rl_common.py                 <- rl_common.py
    base/rl_agent_config.json         <- rl_agent_config.json
    base/encoder/config.json          <- encoder/config.json
    base/tokenizer/tokenizer.json     <- tokenizer/tokenizer.json
    base/tokenizer/tokenizer_config.json

These define the ModernBERT architecture, the tokenizer, and the shared
sequence-rendering / model-construction code. No original weights are
included here.

