================================================================================
Changes made to the base model
================================================================================
The quantized artifacts under out/ are a modified form of the original Laya
weights. Per Section 4(b) of the Apache License, the nature of the changes is
documented here:

  * All 122 weight matrices with >= 16K parameters were replaced by ternary
    values in {-1, 0, +1} with one FP16 scale per group of 128 weights
    (1.738 effective bits per weight, 9.17x smaller than the FP16 original).
  * Normalization weights, biases, the type embedding, the act_head, and the
    per-question-type temperature buffer were left at their original precision.
  * The ternary assignments were produced by GPTQ-style layer-wise calibration
    followed by STE self-distillation fine-tuning against the original model's
    own outputs.

No copyright notice from the original works has been removed, and the
derivative weights remain available under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
